    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the Dungeon. Fight the Physics. Become the Slime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by rage platformers like <i>Getting Over It</i> and <i>Jump King</i>, Up Up Up Up<strong>\u00a0</strong>challenges you to ascend a treacherous vertical dungeon as a determined slime girl \u2014 one slippery bounce at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there\u2019s a catch: you're chained to a massive, unwieldy iron ball that reacts to your every move. Swing it to gain momentum. Use it to reach higher ground. Or, watch helplessly as it drags you down after a single misstep. The physics are unforgiving \u2014 and that's the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26aa Tight, physics-based platforming focused on precision and momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd17 Unique ball-and-chain mechanic that adds a chaotic twist to movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 No checkpoints \u2014 fail and fall, all the way down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc23 A deceptively cute protagonist in a brutally punishing world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 Designed for replayability and speedrunning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 Climb your way up one screen at a time, each with handcrafted platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 This is <i>not</i> a game for the faint of heart \u2014 frustration is part of the journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to escape the dungeon? Prove it.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape the Dungeon. Fight the Physics. Become the Slime.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by rage platformers like <i>Getting Over It</i> and <i>Jump King</i>, Up Up Up Up<strong>\u00a0</strong>challenges you to ascend a treacherous vertical dungeon as a determined slime girl \u2014 one slippery bounce at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But there\u2019s a catch: you're chained to a massive, unwieldy iron ball that reacts to your every move. Swing it to gain momentum. Use it to reach higher ground. Or, watch helplessly as it drags you down after a single misstep. The physics are unforgiving \u2014 and that's the point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26aa Tight, physics-based platforming focused on precision and momentum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd17 Unique ball-and-chain mechanic that adds a chaotic twist to movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 No checkpoints \u2014 fail and fall, all the way down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc23 A deceptively cute protagonist in a brutally punishing world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd01 Designed for replayability and speedrunning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcc8 Climb your way up one screen at a time, each with handcrafted platforming challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 This is <i>not</i> a game for the faint of heart \u2014 frustration is part of the journey</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think you\u2019ve got what it takes to escape the dungeon? Prove it.</p>",
